title: MORPHO trial
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* ''MORPHO:'' In FLT3-ITD AML in first remission, 2 years of gilteritinib maintenance after allogeneic stem cell transplantation showed ''no demonstrated relapse-free survival benefit'' versus placebo in patients with undetectable FLT3-ITD measurable residual disease (MRD) both before and early after transplant (HR 1.213; 95% CI 0.616–2.387; P=0.575; prespecified subgroup). This does not establish equivalence.

Sources: [[Levis 2024|https://doi.org/10.1200/JCO.23.02474]].
